# Dombögen passage: the archway under the Dombögen (Stage 1, cols 205-211,
# rows 10-14: the top 16 px is the dark vault seen through the arch_under
# soffit cut-out, rows 11-14 the passage). Limestone piers i m at both ends
# (lit left edge i, coursed m body with d joints) running from the
# arch_under springing down to the street; between them the d-shadowed
# passage with the far opening onto the Domplatz in very dark B (B/d dither
# edge, the Dom portal in d as a hint).
# Back-layer prop (level prop with layer = "back", D-031): no collision,
# no k and no outline; lower contrast than the playfield tiles.
sprite = dombogen
size   = 112x80
origin = 56,80
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
